e day and streams at night. She dreams of world domination, wanting humans to embrace the life of a cat!\n\nShe loves ribbons, strawberries, and cake! \n\nI included multiple poses, please choose the one you would like to draw the most! \n\nI really like the style of this request: \nhttps://skeb.jp/@pnkt_yksb/works/11\n\nPlease include the PSD file with the character drawings separated from the background. \n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Uk8oUpCACjWZdQutmweTtmZENWwUCJEB?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@pnkt_yksb/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3143590, "client_id": 3589976, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/51f6d1fe/uploads/origins/ce4f4e0b-cfbd-4318-9f9f-8b0d6cfc96ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03c54c1ba83f3394114a41c7011dee3f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/51f6d1fe/uploads/origins/ce4f4e0b-cfbd-4318-9f9f-8b0d6cfc96ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03c54c1ba83f3394114a41c7011dee3f, https://si.imgix.net/51f6d1fe/uploads/origins/ce4f4e0b-cfbd-4318-9f9f-8b0d6cfc96ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a463d1d735f3051b3f5db6ae4efa314 2x, https://si.imgix.net/51f6d1fe/uploads/origins/ce4f4e0b-cfbd-4318-9f9f-8b0d6cfc96ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97e08f7729287f8b0d553acd4bb36b99 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/51f6d1fe/uploads/origins/ce4f4e0b-cfbd-4318-9f9f-8b0d6cfc96ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=17374e96246d058438d36d14cb3e970f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/51f6d1fe/uploads/origins/ce4f4e0b-cfbd-4318-9f9f-8b0d6cfc96